* Task 6 fixture: CALLDBPROC establishes a result set, READ RESULT SET consumes it.
* READ RESULT SET's operand (#RS) is a result-set handle, not a DDM.

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #RS (A20)
  1 #ROW (A100)
END-DEFINE

CALLDBPROC 'GET_DATA'

READ RESULT SET #RS INTO #ROW
  INCLUDE COPY-RECORD
END-RESULT

END
